#: ../../language/error_codes/E0029.md:1
msgid "E0029"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0029.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unused_package`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0029.md:5
msgid ""
"This warning is emitted when a package is listed as an import but the "
"current package does not use that import directly. Explicit imports from "
"`moonbitlang/core` are checked as well."
msgstr "当某个包被列为导入项，但当前包没有直接使用该导入时，会发出此警告。显式导入的 `moonbitlang/core` 包也会接受此项检查。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0029.md:9
msgid ""
"Finding a method or trait implementation through a value's type does not "
"by itself make an explicit import necessary. An import used only for such"
" indirect lookup may therefore still be reported as unused."
msgstr "通过值的类型找到方法或 trait 实现，本身并不表示必须显式导入相应包。因此，仅用于这类间接查找的导入仍可能被报告为未使用。"

